flowchart LR
    Session[Retained SOCK_DIAG session] --> Dump[Bounded listener and connection dumps]
    Dump --> Parse[Strict netlink parser]
    Parse --> Match[Match tuple, state, UID, inode, cookie]
    Match --> ProcFd[Scan visible same-UID proc fd links]
    ProcFd --> Lease[Retained process lease]
    Lease --> Evidence[Unqualified connection evidence]
    Scale[Whole-table scale and reuse window] -. limits .-> Evidence
